sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has implemented device model monitoring<br>and MonitoringCtrlr.Enabled = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: CSMS requests ClearVariableMonitoring ItemsPerMessage from CS

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Manually instruct CSMS to get a report of monitors for:<br>- all DeltaMonitoring<br>- and the variable AvailabilityState for EVSE #1

    CSMS->>CS: GetMonitoringReportRequest (monitoringCriteria = DeltaMonitoring, componentVariable[0] = EVSE / AvailabilityState)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: monitoringCriteria = DeltaMonitoring<br>componentVariable[0].component.name = "EVSE"<br>componentVariable[0].component.evse.id = configured evseId<br>componentVariable[0].variable.name = "AvailabilityState"
    CS-->>CSMS: GetMonitoringReportResponse (status = EmptyResultSet)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Manually instruct CSMS to get a report of monitors for:<br>- all ThresholdMonitoring<br>- and the variable Power of ChargingStation

    CSMS->>CS: GetMonitoringReportRequest (monitoringCriteria = ThresholdMonitoring, componentVariable[0] = ChargingStation / Power)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: monitoringCriteria = ThresholdMonitoring<br>componentVariable[0].component.name = "ChargingStation"<br>componentVariable[0].variable.name = "Power"
    CS-->>CSMS: GetMonitoringReportResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop Repeated as often as needed to report all configuration variables
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyMonitoringReportRequest
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyMonitoringReportResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: Check that CSMS shows the Threshold monitors<br>for Power for ChargingStation
